; M251 — clamp the tool again (clear the M250 drawbar release request).
; Remapped in biber3ax.ini: REMAP = M251 modalgroup=10 ngc=m251
; Clears motion.digital-out-00 (M65 P0). The pendant button can still
; release the tool while held (io.hal, lut5 drawbar-release).

o<m251> sub
  M65 P0
o<m251> endsub
M2
